        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "9bb88c48-1109-56ea-8bca-1b9c45adfc7c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Pocahontas, The Game Plan, The Little Mermaid, Aladdin, Dinosaur, Home on the Range, The Prince and the Pauper\n- People: H. Lee Peterson, Andy Fickman, Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, Audrey Wells, Dwayne Johnson\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures\n- Roles: producer, director, writer, assistant editor, lead film editor, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Pocahontas is a 1995 American animated musical romantic-comedy-drama film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- H. Lee Peterson was an assistant editor for Walt Disney Pictures on The Little Mermaid.\n- H. Lee Peterson was the lead film editor for Walt Disney Pictures on Aladdin, Pocahontas, Dinosaur, Home on the Range, and the short film The Prince and the Pauper starring Mickey Mouse.\n- The Game Plan is a 2007 American family comedy film directed by Andy Fickman and written by Nichole Millard, Kathryn Price, and Audrey Wells.\n- The Game Plan stars Dwayne Johnson and was the last film in which he was billed with his ring name \"The Rock\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
